# Hardware Tests

SDV Hardware Tests are tests designed to be executed on a physical device.

Note that the other CF tests created in the repository may be also be executed on hardware, but these are not included here. Refer to CI/CD configs.

## Naming conventions

- Src file: sdv_hw_name_test.py
- Test class: SdvHWNameTest
- CATBox config: sdv-hw-name-test.xml
